         (x1 gp tp x5 x6 x7 x8 x9 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x16 x17 x18 x19 x20 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x30 x31 : word)
         (P PE PP tl mtl : Z),
    0 <= PP <= PE ->
